needle.js implements inference for the Needle 2 model and interoperates with
the Cactus Compute .cact deployment format.

Primary specifications consulted during implementation:

1. Cactus Compute, "Needle 2"
   https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
   Revision inspected: ee221ce7c13579d9809209b979a9b7a50936614c
   In particular: needle/model/architecture.py, decode.py, export.py,
   quantize.py, tokenizer.py, and needle/model/finetune.py.
   The upstream source repository is MIT licensed.

2. memovai, "MimiModel"
   https://github.com/memovai/mimimodel
   Revision inspected: 994a92581daac25bc6dd857bc2422d93e5c8b88b
   In particular: needle_np.py and needle.c, which document a separately
   validated NumPy/C implementation of the same archive and architecture.
   MimiModel is MIT licensed.

3. Cactus Compute Needle 2 model archive
   https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle2
   Repository revision pinned by this library:
   98fbd955b0347e78059be0c253cc1ffa09b87bc7
   needle2.cact SHA-256:
   b43aabfcaf1a6db6acf488076eab71d823c08697c7af4521fc1d174b60ede5ba
   Published model weights are Apache-2.0 licensed and are not included in
   this source repository.

